23
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:15.417
Suppose an assistant opens a current
vendor page and produces

24
00:02:15.417 --> 00:02:20.833
a summary. The model contributes language
understanding and generation. The

25
00:02:20.833 --> 00:02:26.250
product resolves the location, retrieves
the page, packages content into

26
00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:31.667
context, and may provide citations.
Network access and permissions come

27
00:02:31.667 --> 00:02:37.083
