evidence only after

28
00:02:37.083 --> 00:02:42.500
we confirm its publisher, date, version,
scope, and actual passage.

29
00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:47.917
The summary remains a generated
interpretation. If the assistant also

30
00:02:47.917 --> 00:02:53.333
