31
00:02:53.333 --> 00:02:58.750
If it chooses another source after a
failed check and

32
00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:04.167
repeats, the workflow has agentic
behavior. One interaction can therefore

33
00:03:04.167 --> 00:03:09.583
combine several components. A useful
explanation says which component did

34
00:03:09.583 --> 00:03:15.000
what and which evidence supports the final
claim.

35
00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:21.538
Use AI where pattern recognition and
generation can support a

36
00:03:21.538 --> 00:03:28.077
bounded outcome. Common tasks include
explanation, summarization, rewriting,

37
00:03:28.077 --> 00:03:34.615
