38
00:03:34.615 --> 00:03:41.154
assistance, analysis of supplied data, and
work across supported text,

39
00:03:41.154 --> 00:03:47.692
image, audio, or video inputs. Capability
is not uniform. Results

40
00:03:47.692 --> 00:03:54.231
depend on the exact model and version,
modality, language, task,

41
00:03:54.231 --> 00:04:00.769
prompt, context, tools, and evaluation. A
stronger model does not

42
00:04:00.769 --> 00:04:07.308
