context does not guarantee

43
00:04:07.308 --> 00:04:13.846
that every detail is used correctly.
Multimodal input does not

44
00:04:13.846 --> 00:04:20.385
prove accurate interpretation of every
image or sound. Begin with

45
00:04:20.385 --> 00:04:26.923
a concrete deliverable, permitted relevant
context, constraints, an output contract,

46
00:04:26.923 --> 00:04:33.462
and acceptance checks. Test the exact
available system on representative

47
00:04:33.462 --> 00:04:40.000
examples instead of generalizing from a
