83
00:10:26.143 --> 00:10:31.857
reversible work with clear acceptance
criteria. Raise the bar for

84
00:10:31.857 --> 00:10:37.571
medical, legal, financial, employment,
access, security, safety, production, and

85
00:10:37.571 --> 00:10:43.286
other consequential decisions. These need
current qualified evidence, accountable

86
00:10:43.286 --> 00:10:49.000
human oversight, authorization, audit, and
recovery. Do not delegate responsibility

87
00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:54.714
because a product can produce an answer or
