90
00:11:06.143 --> 00:11:11.857
the task to finding or organizing
information, report the gap,

91
00:11:11.857 --> 00:11:17.571
or stop. The right question is not, can AI

92
00:11:17.571 --> 00:11:23.286
attempt this? It is, can this specific
workflow produce a

93
00:11:23.286 --> 00:11:29.000
