change? How

96
00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:50.000
uncertain are the evidence and model
performance? How reversible is

97
00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:57.000
the output or action? For low-consequence
ideation, human inspection and

98
00:11:57.000 --> 00:12:04.000
clear labeling may be enough. For current
factual work, open

99
00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:11.000
authoritative sources and map claims to
passages. For calculations, independently

100
00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:18.000
reconcile inputs, units, and totals. For
code, run type, test,

101
00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:25.000
build, and behavior checks. For tool
actions, verify the real

102
00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:32.000
target-system postcondition and absence of
duplicate or forbidden effects. Add

103
00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:39.000
independent reviewers and exact approval
as consequence rises. Record pass,

104
00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:46.000
fail, unknown, or not applicable. Stop
when identity, source, target,

105
00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:53.000
permission, or outcome remains too
uncertain for the next action.

106
00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:58.500
Consider an AI-generated meeting agenda
and an AI-generated command that

107
00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:04.000
